#| "The B<putpwent()> function returns 0 on success, or -1 if an error occurs."
msgid ""
"The B<putpwent>()  function returns 0 on success.  On failure, it returns "
"-1, and I<errno> is set to indicate the error."
msgstr ""
"La función B<putpwent()> devuelve 0 en caso de éxito, ó -1 si ocurre un "
"error."

